DIRECTION NOTICE
----------------
hermes-relay enables **Grok Bot → Hermes**.

Grok Bot (cloud) authenticates with OAuth 2.1 and calls MCP tools on this
gateway. The gateway then invokes a local `hermes` CLI as a bounded
subprocess. Hermes cannot call Grok Bot built-in tools through this project.
That reverse direction is impossible unless Grok exposes its own MCP server.

This software does not vendor Hermes Agent. You must install Hermes yourself
and keep `~/.hermes` on the operator machine.
